to create segregation even in  works of art  though laced in the subtext it does  convey the message that black characters  only exist to further the white  character's goal  you very much get the feeling that the  suns here exemplify this  and that they believe themselves better  than atticus even though atticus  descends directly from the person that  they worship  now i love the way that their arrogance  and disregard for atticus is what  blindsides them  and lovecraft country does an excellent  job of taking this trope  flipping it on its head and having  atticus survive whilst the group perish  we'll get into that later though and  atticus finds that samuel actually  revived letty  but that george is still wounded  together atticus and christina discussed  their shared dislike for their fathers  and mirroring this montrose and george  go over how the former hated their dad  george also reveals how atticus may not  even be montrose's son  and this further hammers home the idea  that george and thora had something  going on  atticus is taken to the ceremony whilst  whitey on the moon plays  and its use here shows that atticus is  having to basically be forced into pain  whilst white people around him can  achieve immortality  the portal to eden opens and atticus  sees hannah in the doorway  he realizes that like she did he must  escape the ritual  and the people who wish for nothing more  than to use him until he has no further  use  it becomes clear that hannah was used in  the original ceremony  and this is the reason for the  destruction of the lodge atticus's power  rips through the mansion  and it begins to bring it all crashing  down samuel is petrified  and destroyed and it all ends in a big  blaze of glory  unfortunately we learn that george  succumbed to his wounds  which leaves letty atticus and montrose  on their own  now this differs from the book quite a  lot as george survived  in that and it's quite a devastating  death that i think atticus will blame  himself for  he was told that if he took part in the  ritual that samuel would heal him  but as he didn't he now can't the  necronomicom  is likely what was used to revive letty  and who knows it might even be used to  bring george back to life to to bring  things more in line with the book  i kind of don't think that theory will  happen but yeah there's a lot of things  to consider  it's a big way to end the episode and  yeah what a tough watch  now that pretty much concludes his arc  and ends the first real section of the  book  i will be discussing the upcoming  chapter so if you don't want anything  ruined  then it's time to dive out the video if  you're still here  then going forward it looks like we're  picking up in the next story which  centers around  getting a large inheritance with her  sister she buys a mansion that's very  cheap  and it seems too good to be true it  turns out that it is  and it's actually haunted the white  neighbors in the area also hate that she  and her sister have moved in  and that he comes face to face with the  ghosts that live there which i think  ties into the mention of the  necronomicon  lee of course died and came back to life  and i think the afterlife will be used  heavily in the next episode when she  comes to terms with the ghosts  anyway that's the episodes and preview  and  yeah also i forgot to mention christina  will be back but i don't want to ruin  what happens just yet now obviously i'd  love to hear your thoughts on the entry  so make sure you comment below and let  me know i think last time there were  some much needed corrections on things i  said and interpreted wrongly  and i really appreciate people taking  the time to write them i'm trying to  educate myself on this stuff  quite a lot and it definitely helps the  videos going forward as i do read all  the comments and try to respond to as  many as i can  now if you want to see our breakdown  from last week then make sure you check  it out after this  and don't forget we're giving away a  free copy of the avengers on any console  of your choice  and all you have to do to begin with the  chance of winning is like the video  subscribe to the channel and drop a  comment  the winner is going to be chosen at  random on the 30th of august so make  sure you get involved  if you want to support the channel and  get to see content early then please  consider clicking the join button below  you can also come chat us on a discord  server linked in the description  or heavy spoilers on twitter thanks for  making it until the end of this long  long breakdown  you've been the best i've been  definition i'll see you next time  take care peace  [Music]  you
 

